---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const lastUpdated = "23 May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions governing use of ashmo.io, including content licensing, payments, refunds, liability, indemnity, and UAE governing law."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Terms &"
    highlight="Conditions."
    description={`Terms and conditions governing use of ashmo.io. Last updated: ${lastUpdated}.`}
    primary={{ href: '/privacy-policy/', label: 'Privacy policy' }}
    secondary={{ href: '/legal/', label: 'All legal pages' }}
    stats={[
      { value: 'UAE', label: 'law' },
      { value: '20', label: 'sections' },
      { value: '2026', label: 'updated' },
    ]}
    sideEyebrow="Plain English"
    sideTitle="The rules for using this site, its content, and its digital products."
    sideDescription="Covers acceptable use, content licensing, payments and refunds, liability, indemnity, governing law, and dispute resolution."
  />

  <section class="section-shell pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="cta-panel gradient-border p-6 md:p-8 lg:p-10">
      <div class="prose prose-lg relative z-10 max-w-[760px] space-y-10 text-text font-light leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">1. About These Terms</h2>
          <p>These Terms and Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of <strong>ashmo.io</strong> ("the platform"), operated by <strong>Ashraf Hassan</strong> ("Ashmo") based in Dubai, United Arab Emirates. By accessing the site or using any free or paid content, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">2. Use of the Website</h2>
          <p>The platform is provided for general business, educational, and professional use. You agree to use it lawfully, not to interfere with its operation, not to access it through automated means without permission, and not to attempt to compromise its security.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">3. Free Content and Educational Purpose</h2>
          <p>Articles, frameworks, templates, guides, checklists, dashboards, Excel sheets, Notion templates, prompts, case studies, and downloadable resources published here are educational in nature. They reflect general industry knowledge, personal experience, and original interpretation. They are not professional advice for your specific business.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">4. Paid Content and Digital Products</h2>
          <p>Where you purchase a digital product, course, template, workbook, or consulting package, you receive a limited, personal, non-transferable, non-exclusive licence to use it for your own business or organisation. You may not resell, redistribute, rebrand, sublicense, or republish the content. You may not use it to train AI models, build derivative products for sale, or create competing materials.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">5. No Guarantee of Results</h2>
          <p>Nothing on this platform guarantees business success, revenue, profit, investment return, franchise approval, ecommerce performance, marketing performance, hiring outcomes, or legal or regulatory compliance. Results depend on your market, team, capital, execution, and many factors beyond our control. Examples are illustrative only.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">6. No Professional Advice</h2>
          <p>Content does not constitute legal, financial, tax, accounting, HR, real estate, investment, franchise, immigration, or regulatory advice unless we agree this separately in a written engagement letter. Always consult a qualified professional licensed in your jurisdiction before making decisions.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">7. User Responsibility</h2>
          <p>You are responsible for how you apply any content from this platform. You are responsible for verifying that frameworks, numbers, templates, and approaches are appropriate for your specific situation, market, regulations, and business model. Customisation is required for almost everything.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">8. Payment Terms</h2>
          <p>Prices are displayed in the currency shown at checkout and may exclude applicable taxes. Payment is processed by third-party payment providers; we do not store full card details. By purchasing, you authorise the charge and confirm your payment information is accurate.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">9. Refund Policy</h2>
          <p>Because digital products and downloads are delivered instantly and cannot be returned, sales are generally final. We will consider refund requests in good faith for: duplicate charges, non-delivery, or material defects in the product. Refund requests should be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a> within 7 days of purchase. Consulting fees, once a session has commenced, are non-refundable.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">10. Access Restrictions and Account Termination</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to restrict, suspend, or terminate access to the platform or any account where there is reasonable evidence of misuse, fraud, payment failure, breach of these Terms, or behaviour that puts the platform or other users at risk. Where access is terminated due to your material breach, fees are non-refundable.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">11. Prohibited Use of Content</h2>
          <p>You may not, without prior written permission:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>Copy, resell, redistribute, or republish any content.</li>
            <li>Rebrand, translate, or scrape content for commercial use.</li>
            <li>Upload content into AI training datasets, prompt libraries, or large language model fine-tuning.</li>
            <li>Use content to build competing courses, products, or consulting offers.</li>
            <li>Remove copyright, attribution, or trademark notices.</li>
            <li>Use content for unlawful, defamatory, or misleading purposes.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">12. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content is owned by Ashraf Hassan unless explicitly attributed to another author or licensor. See the <a href="/copyright/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Copyright &amp; IP Policy</a> for full detail.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">13. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the maximum extent permitted by UAE law, Ashraf Hassan and ashmo.io shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, special, exemplary, or punitive damages, loss of profit, loss of business, loss of data, or business interruption arising from your use of the site, its content, or any product purchased here. Total aggregate liability for any direct claim shall not exceed the amount you have paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim, or AED 1,000, whichever is lower.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">14. Indemnity</h2>
          <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Ashraf Hassan and ashmo.io from any claims, damages, liabilities, costs, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising from your misuse of the site, your breach of these Terms, or your violation of any law or third-party right.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">15. Third-Party Links and Tools</h2>
          <p>The platform may link to third-party sites, integrations, or tools. We do not control and are not responsible for their content, terms, privacy, or availability.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">16. Force Majeure</h2>
          <p>We are not liable for any failure or delay in performance caused by events beyond reasonable control — including but not limited to internet outages, hosting provider failure, payment processor outage, government action, natural events, pandemics, war, civil unrest, or cyber incidents.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">17. Right to Update Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of the platform after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">18. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">19. Jurisdiction and Dispute Resolution</h2>
          <p>The parties shall first attempt in good faith to resolve any dispute through informal discussion. If unresolved within 30 days, the dispute shall be submitted to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Dubai, United Arab Emirates, unless otherwise required by mandatory consumer protection law in your jurisdiction.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">20. Contact</h2>
          <p>For questions about these Terms: <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
